@AGENTS.md

Non-negotiable: only edit files inside your lane (see lanes.conf). Read the board before starting
(`scripts/board.sh mine <lane>`), post START/DONE/BLOCKED with `scripts/board.sh post`, and commit only with
`scripts/ship.sh <lane> "msg"`, never with raw `git add .` or `git commit -a`.
